{"id":"f097cd189a36cae9","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-subobject-classifier-injective.md","title":"Theorem — 分类子的典范延拓与内射性","display":"Theorem — 分类子的典范延拓与内射性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-subobject-classifier-injective","aliases":["14-thm-subobject-classifier-injective"],"display":"Theorem — 分类子的典范延拓与内射性","depends_on":["[[14-df-elementary-topos]]","[[14-df-subobject-classifier]]","[[14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism]]","[[14-df-subobjects]]","[[14-df-pullbacks-equalizers]]","[[14-thm-power-object-classification]]","[[14-df-injective-object]]"],"source_location":"IV.10 Proposition1 and proof, printed 210; DjVu111","source_evidence":"附件中的原稿来源记录；本次修订不构成对相应原书或 OCR 的读取证明。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-subobject-classifier-injective"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-subobject-classifier-injective</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — 分类子的典范延拓与内射性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" href=\"?note=4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" title=\"14-df-elementary-topos\">14-df-elementary-topos</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a0c7f4bf5e51d4b5\" href=\"?note=a0c7f4bf5e51d4b5\" title=\"14-df-subobject-classifier\">14-df-subobject-classifier</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8e7f6de1ab6fc49f\" href=\"?note=8e7f6de1ab6fc49f\" title=\"14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism\">14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d3923e299ec2ec5a\" href=\"?note=d3923e299ec2ec5a\" title=\"14-df-subobjects\">14-df-subobjects</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"199dc3cf97e92fa1\" href=\"?note=199dc3cf97e92fa1\" title=\"14-df-pullbacks-equalizers\">14-df-pullbacks-equalizers</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2f47f9749d4510aa\" href=\"?note=2f47f9749d4510aa\" title=\"14-thm-power-object-classification\">14-thm-power-object-classification</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d1900a6f3b1135c9\" href=\"?note=d1900a6f3b1135c9\" title=\"14-df-injective-object\">14-df-injective-object</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_location","html":"IV.10 Proposition1 and proof, printed 210; DjVu111"},{"key":"source_evidence","html":"附件中的原稿来源记录；本次修订不构成对相应原书或 OCR 的读取证明。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 是初等拓扑斯，固定终对象 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> 与子对象分类子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\Omega,\\top)\">\\((\\Omega,\\top)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_Y:\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(Y)\\to\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(Y,\\Omega)\">\\(\\chi_Y:\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(Y)\\to\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(Y,\\Omega)\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"2f47f9749d4510aa\" href=\"?note=2f47f9749d4510aa\" title=\"14-thm-power-object-classification\">14-thm-power-object-classification</a> 的同一分类对应，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]\">\\([n]\\)</span> 为单态射的子对象类。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m:S\\to B\">\\(m:S\\to B\\)</span> 是单态射，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:S\\to\\Omega\">\\(f:S\\to\\Omega\\)</span>。内射性见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"d1900a6f3b1135c9\" href=\"?note=d1900a6f3b1135c9\" title=\"14-df-injective-object\">14-df-injective-object</a>，唯一描述 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota\">\\(\\iota\\)</span> 只在相应存在唯一性成立的下列输入上使用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(S,\\Omega)\\quad\\exists!g\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(B,\\Omega)\\ \\exists R\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\exists n\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(R,S)\\quad\n\\operatorname{IsMono}(n)\\land\\chi_S([n])=f\\land g=\\chi_B([m\\circ n]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(S,\\Omega)\\quad\\exists!g\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(B,\\Omega)\\ \\exists R\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\exists n\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(R,S)\\quad\n\\operatorname{IsMono}(n)\\land\\chi_S([n])=f\\land g=\\chi_B([m\\circ n]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Ext}^{\\Omega}_m(f):=\\iota g\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(B,\\Omega)\\ \\exists R\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\exists n\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(R,S)\\\n\\left(\\operatorname{IsMono}(n)\\land\\chi_S([n])=f\\land g=\\chi_B([m\\circ n])\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Ext}^{\\Omega}_m(f):=\\iota g\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(B,\\Omega)\\ \\exists R\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\exists n\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(R,S)\\\n\\left(\\operatorname{IsMono}(n)\\land\\chi_S([n])=f\\land g=\\chi_B([m\\circ n])\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ext}^{\\Omega}_m:\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(S,\\Omega)\\to\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(B,\\Omega),\\qquad\n\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(S,\\Omega)\\quad\\operatorname{Ext}^{\\Omega}_m(f)\\circ m=f.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ext}^{\\Omega}_m:\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(S,\\Omega)\\to\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(B,\\Omega),\\qquad\n\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(S,\\Omega)\\quad\\operatorname{Ext}^{\\Omega}_m(f)\\circ m=f.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IsInjective}_{\\mathcal E}(\\Omega).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{IsInjective}_{\\mathcal E}(\\Omega).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>由分类对应，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 唯一对应一个子对象类，选代表 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n:R\\hookrightarrow S\">\\(n:R\\hookrightarrow S\\)</span>。复合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"mn\">\\(mn\\)</span> 仍单；其子对象类与代表无关：若两代表通过同构相连，复合后仍通过同一同构相连。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_B([mn])\">\\(\\chi_B([mn])\\)</span> 存在且由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,m\">\\(f,m\\)</span> 唯一确定。</p>\n<p>因为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 单，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"mn\">\\(mn\\)</span> 组成的方块（其余边为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1_R\">\\(1_R\\)</span>）是拉回。将 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"mn\">\\(mn\\)</span> 的分类方块沿 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 拉回，得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 的分类方块，所以特征箭头唯一性给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_B([mn])m=f\">\\(\\chi_B([mn])m=f\\)</span>。这逐个构造了所需延拓。这里唯一的是选定的“把该子对象直接看作B子对象”的延拓构造；一般沿 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 的所有延拓并不唯一，没有加强<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"d1900a6f3b1135c9\" href=\"?note=d1900a6f3b1135c9\" title=\"14-df-injective-object\">14-df-injective-object</a>的定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-elementary-topos","status":"resolved","id":"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-elementary-topos]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-subobject-classifier","status":"resolved","id":"a0c7f4bf5e51d4b5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-subobject-classifier]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism","status":"resolved","id":"8e7f6de1ab6fc49f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-subobjects","status":"resolved","id":"d3923e299ec2ec5a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-subobjects]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-pullbacks-equalizers","status":"resolved","id":"199dc3cf97e92fa1","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-pullbacks-equalizers]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-power-object-classification","status":"resolved","id":"2f47f9749d4510aa","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-power-object-classification]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-injective-object","status":"resolved","id":"d1900a6f3b1135c9","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-injective-object]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-power-object-classification","status":"resolved","id":"2f47f9749d4510aa","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 是初等拓扑斯，固定终对象 $1$ 与子对象分类子 $(\\Omega,\\top)$。$\\chi_Y:\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(Y)\\to\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(Y,\\Omega)$ 使用 [[14-thm-power-object-classification]] 的同一分类对应，$[n]$ 为单态射的子对象类。$m:S\\to B$ 是单态射，$f:S\\to\\Omega$。内射性见 [[14-df-injective-object]]，唯一描述 $\\iota$ 只在相应存在唯一性成立的下列输入上使用。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-injective-object","status":"resolved","id":"d1900a6f3b1135c9","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 是初等拓扑斯，固定终对象 $1$ 与子对象分类子 $(\\Omega,\\top)$。$\\chi_Y:\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(Y)\\to\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(Y,\\Omega)$ 使用 [[14-thm-power-object-classification]] 的同一分类对应，$[n]$ 为单态射的子对象类。$m:S\\to B$ 是单态射，$f:S\\to\\Omega$。内射性见 [[14-df-injective-object]]，唯一描述 $\\iota$ 只在相应存在唯一性成立的下列输入上使用。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-injective-object","status":"resolved","id":"d1900a6f3b1135c9","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"因为 $m$ 单，$n$ 与 $mn$ 组成的方块（其余边为 $m$ 和 $1_R$）是拉回。将 $mn$ 的分类方块沿 $m$ 拉回，得到 $n$ 的分类方块，所以特征箭头唯一性给 $\\chi_B([mn])m=f$。这逐个构造了所需延拓。这里唯一的是选定的“把该子对象直接看作B子对象”的延拓构造；一般沿 $m$ 的所有延拓并不唯一，没有加强[[14-df-injective-object]]的定义。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"(\\Omega,\\top)","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_Y:\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(Y)\\to\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(Y,\\Omega)","display":false},{"tex":"[n]","display":false},{"tex":"m:S\\to B","display":false},{"tex":"f:S\\to\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(S,\\Omega)\\quad\\exists!g\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(B,\\Omega)\\ \\exists R\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\exists n\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(R,S)\\quad\n\\operatorname{IsMono}(n)\\land\\chi_S([n])=f\\land g=\\chi_B([m\\circ n]).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Ext}^{\\Omega}_m(f):=\\iota g\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(B,\\Omega)\\ \\exists R\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\exists n\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(R,S)\\\n\\left(\\operatorname{IsMono}(n)\\land\\chi_S([n])=f\\land g=\\chi_B([m\\circ n])\\right).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ext}^{\\Omega}_m:\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(S,\\Omega)\\to\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(B,\\Omega),\\qquad\n\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(S,\\Omega)\\quad\\operatorname{Ext}^{\\Omega}_m(f)\\circ m=f.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{IsInjective}_{\\mathcal E}(\\Omega).","display":true},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"n:R\\hookrightarrow S","display":false},{"tex":"mn","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_B([mn])","display":false},{"tex":"f,m","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"mn","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"1_R","display":false},{"tex":"mn","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_B([mn])m=f","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false}],"bytes":2829,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-167","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-subobject-classifier-injective|Theorem — 分类子的典范延拓与内射性]]"},{"id":"af8af33cef1d96d9","anchor":"ref-147","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-subobject-classifier-injective]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-304","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-subobject-classifier-injective]]"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-226","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-subobject-classifier-injective]]"},{"id":"a847472bc37dd64a","anchor":"ref-21","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-subobject-classifier-injective]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-168","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-subobject-classifier-injective|Theorem — 分类子的典范延拓与内射性]]"},{"id":"c2459b62252fa306","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"将 $h:S\\to K^A$ 反转置为 $S\\times A\\to K$。$K$ 的内射性沿 $m\\times1_A$ 给一个延拓 $g:B\\times A\\to K$，再转置为 $\\Lambda(g):B\\to K^A$。求值方程和转置唯一性给 $\\Lambda(g)m=h$。这是对每个 $h$ 的实际构造，因而得到指数内射性。对 $K=\\Omega$ 应用[[14-thm-subobject-classifier-injective]]即为原书幂对象推论。一般指数保持内射的表述是在同一论证中抽出的补充，不另假定范畴有全部余极限。"}],"outgoing":["4e6c05c92e3b9bf9","a0c7f4bf5e51d4b5","8e7f6de1ab6fc49f","d3923e299ec2ec5a","199dc3cf97e92fa1","2f47f9749d4510aa","d1900a6f3b1135c9"]}